[{"title":"沧浪波","author":"杨基","text":"入苑绿泱泱，縠纹融暖光。\n东风吹白浪，照见赤龙堂。\n龙堂负贝阙，阴火春波热。\n鲛人卖髯绡，夜夜唱明月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16348,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绮川游","author":"杨基","text":"川水东北流，川花照青楼。\n龙船载凤吹，日来川上游。\n沙明属玉止，苕香翡翠留。\n渔郎蒲叶底，网得双吴钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16349,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茂苑思","author":"杨基","text":"辇路秋蓬满，野香团绿湿。\n嫔娥粉黛愁，嫣花铅露泣。\n莺声旧时好，玉砌秋归早。\n东家胡蝶飞，烟姿满芳草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16350,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"食烧笋留题陈惟寅竹间","author":"杨基","text":"春雷一声万簪玉，参差乱迸莓苔绿。\n斩来扫叶当径烧，何异燃萁煮秋菽。\n登盘查牙玉版肥，焦尾碎剥苍龙皮。\n山人大嚼无以报，写作林间烧笋诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16351,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏七姊妹花","author":"杨基","text":"红罗斗结同心小，七蕊参差弄春晓。\n尽是东风儿女魂，蛾眉一样青螺扫。\n三姊娉婷四妹娇，绿窗虚度可怜宵。\n八姨秦国休相妒，肠断江东大小乔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16352,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清溪渔隐","author":"杨基","text":"清溪秋来水如练，历历鱼虾皆可见。\n绿蓑酒醒雁初飞，风急芦花吹满面。\n溪南一带是青山，逢着垂杨便可湾。\n谩道白鸥闲似我，渔舟更比白鸥闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16353,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻蝉","author":"杨基","text":"眉庵四十未闻道，偶于世事无所好。\n寻常惟看东家竹，屈指十年今不到。\n微躯之外无长物，寒暑一裘兼一帽。\n妻孥屡叹升斗绝，不独无烟亦无灶。\n身轻自笑可驾鹤，眼明岂止堪窥豹。\n人情世故看烂熟，皎不如污恭胜傲。\n有瑕可指未为辱，无善足称方入妙。\n此意于今觉更深，静倚南风听蝉噪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16354,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠故人全王孙","author":"杨基","text":"兄为柱国弟开府，门吏纷纷皆绣斧。\n敕赐龙河百亩宫，画戟丹弓映朱户。\n金凤盘胸白锦襦，面如红玉紫虬须。\n六宫晓逐诸王入，八府春随宰相趋。\n东风忽念江南好，宝骑看花踏春草。\n茂苑莺声醉里听，建章柳色愁中老。\n回首瀛洲草木新，苍颜白发照乌巾。\n都将秋水蛇纹剑，赠与长安游侠人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16355,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白头母吟","author":"杨基","text":"白头母，乌头妇，妇姑啼寒抱双股。\n妇哭征夫母哭儿，悲风吹折庭前树。\n家有屋，屯军伍，家家有儿遭杀虏。\n越女能嘲楚女词，吴人半作淮人语。\n东营放火夜斫门，白日横尸向官路。\n母言我侬年少时，夫妻种花花绕蹊。\n夫亡子去寸心折，花窦花窠成瓦埒。\n十年不吃江州茶，八年不归姊妹家。\n兰芽菊本已冻死，惟有春风荠菜花。\n只怜新妇生苦晚，不见当时富及奢。\n珠帘台榭桃花坞，笙歌院落王家府。\n如今芳草野乌啼，鬼火磷磷日未西。\n侬如叶上霜，死即在奄忽。\n新妇固如花，春来瘦成骨。\n妇听姑言泪如雨，妾身已抱桥边柱。\n纵使征夫戍不归，芳心誓不随波去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16356,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春风行","author":"杨基","text":"春风吹花快如剪，柳条婆娑颜色浅。\n四更急雨作轻寒，零落余香上苔藓。\n街泥污人不出户，强以一樽聊自遣。\n西家酒熟复苦贵，收拾春衣倩人典。\n斋厨久断鱼肉腥，细嚼芹菹胜禁脔。\n时平戚戚恐寒饥，况乃厄运愁不免。\n丑妻念我忧无薪，私爨破箦炊户楗。\n客来嗟吁但枯坐，惭愧不得具茶荈。\n今朝棠梨开一花，天气自佳日色篽。\n西南诸峰宛在望，暖霭晴烟张翠筜。\n去年骢马虎丘前，醉折樱桃随步辇。\n只今咫尺烽火隔，高栅长营依堑转。\n极目郊原草树空，那得锄犁到沟畎。\n东吴自经五世乱，四百余年绝兵燹。\n物盛还衰满则亏，此理甚明知者鲜。\n嗟予亲老诸弟隔，昼夜蹙额眉不展。\n巷哭邻呼不敢闻，何暇谆谆问牛喘。\n楼前旌旗芳草阔，紫燕未归帘半卷。\n呼儿插花向晴昊，手把短须吟更拈。\n准拟青鞋到处游，绕堤蒲柳春泥软。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16357,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春愁曲","author":"杨基","text":"小楼十日听雨卧，春云作团拂帘过。\n金黄杨柳晓初匀，雪白梨花春半破。\n东家胡蝶飞无数，西邻燕子归两个。\n玉关万里尺书稀，春风不似春愁大。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16358,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"结客少年场行","author":"杨基","text":"情如飞絮任悠扬，心与游丝共短长。\n花底若教连日醉，座中犹可少年狂。\n新调锦瑟争传谱，巧制罗囊别贮香。\n衣以凤翎分缝织，带将蛇角遍軿装。\n豪名独擅秋千社，狭气平欺蹴鞠场。\n白璧一双酬剑客，明珠百斛买胡娼。\n金丸挟弹章台左，宝骑闻筝太液傍。\n梅子短墙羞掷果，桃花深坞笑分浆。\n每嘲春比人先老，不信愁如海叵量。\n犹有旧时桃李梦，尚随胡蝶到辽阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16359,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"球场曲","author":"杨基","text":"软红十里平如掌，马蹄踏沙轻不响。\n金袍玉带五陵儿，飞骑击球珠作赏。\n身轻擘捷马游龙，彩仗低昂一点红。\n倏忽飞星入云表，据鞍回袖接春风。\n有时随地香尘滚，杨花乱扑桃花粉。\n就窝夺得笑归来，月牙轻旋骊珠稳。\n一生娇贵厌朝天，不信人间有倒悬。\n但得花间风月好，打球场上自年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16360,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"废宅行","author":"杨基","text":"弓刀挂墙旗拂瓦，行人过门须下马。\n日暮将军纵酒归，白棒横街人乱打。\n朱门一闭春草积，官印斜封泥涴壁。\n守卒收釐屋后池，邻翁晒麦阶前石。\n帘幕当年尽绮罗，网丝颠倒腐萤多。\n杏梁风雨丹青湿，时有野鸠来做窠。\n楼台易成还易废，前年犹是桑麻地。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16361,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中柳","author":"杨基","text":"春雪晚萧萧，随莺上柳条。\n渐将丝共结，终与絮俱飘。\n泪粉凝啼眼，珍珠压舞腰。\n东风自怜惜，留映赤栏桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16362,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中燕","author":"杨基","text":"燕雪两差池，相兼拂绣帏。\n玉楼迷故垒，珠箔见乌衣。\n斜讶冲花落，轻疑掠絮飞。\n晓寒人未起，还认画梁归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16363,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋斋杂赋五首 其一","author":"杨基","text":"刘表知先主，怀王识沛公。\n未闻收夏口，先已入关中。\n今古车书异，兴衰历数同。\n方惊鸡作凤，当信鹜非鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16364,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋斋杂赋五首 其二","author":"杨基","text":"今日长洲苑，秋风列羽旗。\n不图新约法，复见旧威仪。\n鼓舞儿童乐，歌谣父老悲。\n烟埃方衮衮，禾黍正离离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16365,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋斋杂赋五首 其三","author":"杨基","text":"叹息冯唐老，吁嗟李广贤。\n穷通元有命，生死讵非天。\n鼓角西风里，江湖短发前。\n南飞有鸿雁，一字若为传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16366,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋斋杂赋五首 其四","author":"杨基","text":"晚树霜犹碧，秋花雨未黄。\n戎衣轻绣锦，旅食尚糟糠。\n驿路千山隔，河流一苇航。\n毋忧兵不战，已定法三章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16367,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋斋杂赋五首 其五","author":"杨基","text":"逻卒去不返，行人愁未回。\n正须犀作甲，毋用玉为杯。\n清泪寻常落，丹心早晚灰。\n交仍期管鲍，书或似邹枚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16368,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日舟中见蝶","author":"杨基","text":"趁暖戏晴川，依人上画船。\n粉销烟翅薄，香冷露须拳。\n野菜疏篱外，山花小径边。\n夜深桃李梦，犹在绮罗筵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16369,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷叶","author":"杨基","text":"圆的破蓬苞，孤茎上藕梢。\n雨撑栖鹭屋，风卷荫龟巢。\n溪友裁巾帻，虚人作饭包。\n小娃曾已折，新月里湖坳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16370,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨","author":"杨基","text":"雨急愁云黑，窗虚爱竹青。\n石泉流细细，山鸟去冥冥。\n醉里倾荷叶，饥来煮茯苓。\n不知刘道士，何用换鹅经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16371,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题","author":"杨基","text":"身懒交游绝，时危感慨新。\n清江催短鬓，芳草怨归人。\n花落纵横雨，莺啼淡荡春。\n欲摇舟楫去，波浪没平津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16372,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠沈真仲征士","author":"杨基","text":"花落满烟莎，兰舟喜见过。\n壮心丹未已，愁鬓绿无多。\n小燕斜斜舞，新莺婉婉歌。\n都将旧游意，一笑付江波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16373,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王仲容之上海","author":"杨基","text":"薄宦依东海，孤城隔戍烟。\n花疏寒食后，人远暮帆前。\n深巷编蒲履，斜岗种木绵。\n毋烦厌荒寂，微禄有畬田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16374,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄叶德彰戴叔能","author":"杨基","text":"江远树层层，蒲荷叶渐增。\n酒樽池阁雨，棋局夜船灯。\n竹净删逾瘦，花疏扫未能。\n亭亭川上鹄，风雨看飞腾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16375,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄海盐杨寨官","author":"杨基","text":"海屿通村险，边城出敌遥。\n旗灯秋雨塞，铃柝夜沟潮。\n士饱争投石，农闲数舞箾。\n毋令废收获，高陇有枯苗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16376,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠婉素","author":"杨基","text":"同祀碧鸡神，丝萝又结姻。\n文如谢道韫，书逼卫夫人。\n冀缺终相敬，梁鸿不厌贫。\n还能事荆布，归钓五湖滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16377,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"方氏园居七首 其一","author":"杨基","text":"北墅花连屋，东园菊绕庄。\n病长陪客坐，老不厌人狂。\n鹅鸭双陂雨，楂梨小树霜。\n他年倘相遇，里邑定名方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16378,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"方氏园居七首 其二","author":"杨基","text":"多水少尘埃，经年不扫苔。\n竹繁频洗菜，松老别求栽。\n雪窦看碑入，云窗晒帖开。\n徐文与张羽，乘月想能来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16379,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"方氏园居七首 其三","author":"杨基","text":"秋气入郊墟，新凉似雨余。\n囊收试验药，稿集著成书。\n酒熟知愁减，花开觉病除。\n何曾废钱买，山果及溪鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16380,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"方氏园居七首 其四","author":"杨基","text":"解佩酬琴价，将书当酒赀。\n竹楼听雪夜，梅屋看花时。\n女嫁为农妇，儿从作圃师。\n邻翁无奈俗，招饮岂能辞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16381,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"方氏园居七首 其五","author":"杨基","text":"旧物嗟孤剑，春风别五陵。\n未衰先遣妾，已静更疏僧。\n往事真骑虎，中年得纵鹰。\n两溪千顷月，谈坐不须灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16382,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"方氏园居七首 其六","author":"杨基","text":"由来种瓜地，随处即青门。\n习俗羞营利，甘贫耻受恩。\n挂蓑秋树湿，濯足晚溪浑。\n欲访龆年友，漂零只自存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16383,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"方氏园居七首 其七","author":"杨基","text":"回汀兼复渚，迢递入渔邦。\n有港皆通楫，无山不到窗。\n疏烟春陇犊，深雪夜篱厖。\n过客停舟问，而翁恐姓庞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16384,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送路季琏问聘河东时东驾出师太原","author":"杨基","text":"三晋封疆拱帝圻，两河山色照戎衣。\n青虹贯日随星出，赤鸟如云夹电飞。\n使者梅花春后折，王孙芳草梦中归。\n入朝若问东南事，积粟如山万马肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16385,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻官军南征解围有日喜而遂咏二首 其一","author":"杨基","text":"两河精骑向襄阳，全蜀材臣出凤翔。\n天下风云争会合，江东子弟谩抢攘。\n人皆厌乱思平世，谁不将归说故乡。\n我有先茔依古井，十年不奠一壶浆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16386,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻官军南征解围有日喜而遂咏二首 其二","author":"杨基","text":"官军闻说下扬州，梦里扶摇赋远游。\n天运未容人力胜，民心须顺物情求。\n遭逢丧乱生何补，见得升平死即休。\n沽取一壶花下酌，弟兄儿女笑相酬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16387,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄杨铁厓","author":"杨基","text":"不见云间杨铁史，寮中七客近如何。\n老来诗句疏狂甚，乱后文章感慨多。\n长笛参差吹海凤，小琼杨柳舞天魔。\n春明且尽嬉游乐，莫解梁鸿《五噫歌》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16388,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀悼朱秦仲总制","author":"杨基","text":"力尽戈籥援不回，犹挥赤手搏风雷。\n波涛失意蛟龙伏，肝胆如杠虎豹摧。\n谩使张辽说关羽，谁将全武易秦裴。\n烦君更缓须臾死，要对春风酒一杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16389,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郡斋养疴呈醉樵内史二首 其一","author":"杨基","text":"江云倏忽暝还收，五月犹寒著弊裘。\n芳草斜阳看易晚，绿荷疏雨听如秋。\n池塘空阔蜻蜓喜，帘幕萧条燕子愁。\n不是无言成独坐，暂将心事静中求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16390,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郡斋养疴呈醉樵内史二首 其二","author":"杨基","text":"小轩新沐喜神清，短帻单衣觉渐轻。\n松下琴书晴亦润，竹西窗户晚犹明。\n愁来对酒心先醉，病后看花意懒行。\n却忆故山深处立，绿萝千树叫流莺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16391,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和谢雪坡钱塘见寄","author":"杨基","text":"经旬不见谢宣城，小楷乌丝寄远情。\n黄篾楼高春梦破，绿罗衣薄暮寒生。\n鹤临沙渚鸥俱浴，花落江泥燕与争。\n亦欲雨蓑摇短楫，西湖新水荡空明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16392,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赤山书事寄龟巢谢隐君君南兰陵人今避兵居吴长洲之独树湖","author":"杨基","text":"曾向溪南看艺麻，竹杠兜子一肩斜。\n秧苗尚短仍含谷，荷叶才高已上花。\n蚕屋柘烟朝焙茧，鹊炉沉火昼薰茶。\n而今风雨成抛绝，卧听西园两部蛙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16393,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雪坡将还吴门","author":"杨基","text":"桑叶重重戴胜飞，行人多报故人归。\n鬓从别后星星出，花到春深树树稀。\n诗喜官闲能不废，身缘谋拙事多违。\n便须出郭相迎迓，遮莫南风雨满衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16394,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江村寒食","author":"杨基","text":"预折杨枝插绕檐，豆糜香软麦饧甜。\n春衣未染新丝织，午篆犹分旧火添。\n小雨送花青见萼，轻雷催笋碧抽尖。\n不因人远伤离别，那得春愁上短髯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16395,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂咏二首 其一","author":"杨基","text":"偶自循篱出径苔，刺桐花落野棠开。\n一年春已无多在，几个人曾有暇来。\n浸谷陂塘科斗乱，浴蚕时节杜鹃哀。\n买山莫种闲花柳，多觅松栽与柏栽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16396,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂咏二首 其二","author":"杨基","text":"陋巷荒芜野趣浓，小溪春水恰船通。\n无边草色犹春雨，有几梅花更晚风。\n文体敢期卢骆并，交情惟许范张同。\n欲将浪迹随沤鸟，错比溪南是瀼东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16397,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"残雪","author":"杨基","text":"庭雪半消残，犹存旧腊寒。\n春风如有意，留待隔年看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16398,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陌上桑","author":"杨基","text":"青青陌上桑，叶叶带春雨。\n已有催丝人，咄咄桑下语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16399,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"隔帘听歌","author":"杨基","text":"低处最多情，声迟拍转停。\n坐中肠亦断，况乃隔帘听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16400,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花开","author":"杨基","text":"花开醉不休，花谢莫深愁。\n纵使花长在，东风也白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16401,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壶中二色桃花","author":"杨基","text":"素颊映红腮，西园共折来。\n怜渠竟先落，知是最先开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16402,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折花赠内并代答二首 其一","author":"杨基","text":"人面玉娟娟，花枝更可怜。\n凭从画眉手，折寄镜台前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16403,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折花赠内并代答二首 其二","author":"杨基","text":"一朵折春风，花浓意更浓。\n而今映花面，不似向时红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16404,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瓶中插梨杏桃李四花有咏","author":"杨基","text":"各自媚春光，轻红映浅妆。\n日融花气暖，忘却是谁香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16405,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弹琴高士","author":"杨基","text":"江静月在水，山空秋满亭。\n自弹还自罢，初不要人听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16406,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白云泉","author":"杨基","text":"泠泠白云泉，流向白云边。\n泉水流不断，白云飞上天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16407,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"杨基","text":"窗寒雪乱飞，雁带边声过。\n对影却增愁，吹灯暗中坐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16408,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示杨水西","author":"杨基","text":"亲远更家贫，将归未有因。\n相逢难说与，君是故乡人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16409,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即景四首 其一","author":"杨基","text":"长眉短眉柳叶，深色浅色桃花。\n小桥小店沽酒，新火新烟煮茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16410,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即景四首 其二","author":"杨基","text":"今年去年酒债，三月两月春愁。\n看山看水出郭，听雨听风倚楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16411,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即景四首 其三","author":"杨基","text":"东家西家燕飞，明日后日春归。\n多愁多病送客，无酒无钱典衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16412,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]